  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR - Gender Equality Among Refugees in Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR Mexico will seek to work on three main axes in the area of gender equality to (1) mitigate the risk of gender-based violence for people forced to flee and (2) ensure that all survivors have adequate and timely access to services, as well as promote the economic inclusion of women refugees and asylum-seekers through (3) support, information and follow-up about how to access public and private services, such as childcare.</narrative>
  </description>
